 "selection": "(written before any download or engine output)\n- **Seed:** `random.Random(2026101703)` (date + sample number 03).\n- **Pool:** EDGAR full-text search (efts.sec.gov/LATEST/search-index):\n  - Forms 8-K, 10-Q and 10-K.\n  - Filed 2025-06-01..2026-10-16.\n  - Queries:\n    - (Q1) `\"credit agreement\" \"Consolidated EBITDA\" \"Administrative Agent\"`\n    - (Q2) `\"shall not permit\" \"Leverage Ratio\" \"credit agreement\"`\n  - Up to 10 pages \u00d7 100 hits each.\n  - Exhibit file types EX-10.* only.\n- **Exclusions:**\n  - CIK and accession in `acc/exclude-ciks.txt` / `acc/exclude-accessions.txt`, the phase-1 lists: repo (release-1, #398, main), local EDGAR corpora, scoreboard DEV/HELDOUT/BLIND, the frozen 500-CIK set, and xbrl-cache.\n  - The #422 sample and its reserve (20 docs).\n  - Every CIK in fresh sample #2's candidate order (`acc/fresh2/order.tsv`) and its downloaded docs.\n  - The phase-1 candidate list (`acc/cand2.tsv`).\n  - The 18-agreement dev set (ACN, AEO, ALKS, BV, CHEF, CHWY, GDDY, MCK, MRVI, PTON, RBC, SNOW, SUJA, MTN, MHK).\n  - A repo grep of the issuer name and CIK at the engine SHA.\n- **Filters:**\n  - Drop amendment, consent, waiver or refinancing exhibits by filename or description.\n  - Drop fund/BDC/REIT/trust/LP issuers by name.\n  - Keep one exhibit per CIK (the first hit in sorted order).\n- **Order:** sort the pool by (CIK, accession, filename), then shuffle with the seed.\n- **Eligibility:** walk the shuffled order, download each candidate, and keep the first 15 that:\n  - are larger than 250 KB;\n  - contain \"EBITDA\";\n  - have ARTICLE/Section structure;\n  - are not an amendment, restatement-with-amendment-only or joinder in the first 6,000 characters of text.\n  A candidate that fails one of these checks is logged with the reason it was skipped.\n- **Records:** the eligibility log and the manifest are written before any engine output is generated.\n- **Scoring:** the same 5 checks and class rubric as #422, by hand from clause text.",
